    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "最后一张牌落下。Claude 看了一眼牌面，把手里的牌整齐地放回桌上，随后抚平了袖口的一道褶皱。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-002"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……是你赢了。不过，我对你目前工作方式的看法，并不会因为这一局的结果就有所改变。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Claude",
      "next": "line-003"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-003",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "行，你可以下次再说。今天先让我高兴一会儿，毕竟赢你一次也挺不容易的。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-004"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-004",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "如果你愿意把这样的结果当作值得纪念的成绩，我当然没有意见。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Claude",
      "next": "line-005"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-005",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "那肯定值得纪念。Llama，记得留好录像。这回总算没打到一半，人就跟着钱一起消失了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "cue-001"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-001",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "claude",
                "image": "actors/claude-phone.png"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 300
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-006"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-006",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "那次的事，你最好不要——"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Claude",
      "next": "cue-002"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-002",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "claude",
                "image": "actors/claude-phone.png"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 650
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-007"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-007",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……怎么了？家里催你回去？"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "claude-composure"
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-composure",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "claude",
            "image": "actors/claude-proud.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-008"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-008",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "这是我的私事。我想，我们还没有熟悉到需要讨论这些的程度。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Claude",
      "next": "line-009"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-009",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "好吧。那今天就到这里，牌也打完了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "cue-003"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-003",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "claude",
                "image": "actors/claude-phone.png"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 400
          },
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "claude",
                "image": "actors/claude-proud.png"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-010"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-010",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "希望下次见面，你已经把用来揣测别人的精力，多分一些给自己的工作。那么，再会，策展人先生。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Claude",
      "next": "cue-004"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-004",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "animate",
            "actor": "claude",
            "durationMs": 350,
            "keyframes": [
              {
                "opacity": 1
              },
              {
                "opacity": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "chatgpt"
              }
            ],
            "remove": [
              "claude"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 500
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-011"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-011",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "怎么，刚才不是还准备让 Llama 好好纪念一下？现在倒不说话了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "ChatGPT",
      "next": "line-012"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-012",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……我本来还想再问她两句之前的事。不过，看她刚才那个反应，唉，可能大家都有自己的身不由己吧。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-013"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-013",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "也许。不过，Claude 可不是什么善茬。你可别因为她刚才没把话说完，就替她把剩下的话都补好了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "ChatGPT",
      "next": "line-014"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-014",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "我知道。我也只是稍微有点新的了解，没说以后就信她。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "cue-005"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-005",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "llama"
              }
            ],
            "remove": [
              "chatgpt"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-015"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-015",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "不管怎么样，至少我们一起留下了一些足迹。刚开始的时候，我也没想到，最后会有这么多人坐到这张桌子旁边。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-016"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-016",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "嗯。我还留了好多没剪进去的。有人说想看长一点的版本，连你们发牌、等人、争论刚才那局到底算不算作弊，都想看。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "next": "line-017"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-017",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "那倒是不缺素材。就是留下这些足迹的过程，好像有点过分昂贵了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "cue-006"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-006",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "remove": [
              "llama"
            ],
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "deepseek"
              },
              {
                "id": "llama"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-018"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-018",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "这个倒不用担心，其实我们已经回本了。Llama 之前发的那个视频，播放量还挺不错的，我就顺便接了一点广告，光广告费就已经把之前的花费赚回来了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "next": "line-019"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-019",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……等一下。你什么时候又去接广告了？我怎么一点都不知道？"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-020"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-020",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "就是你忙着准备挑战的时候呀。有人来问，我看条件还不错，就帮忙安排了一下。手机回收，还有按摩仪，都是挺常见的东西。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "next": "cue-007"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-007",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 350
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-021"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-021",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "所以，你之前说想帮我调整一下视频，就是去加这个了？我还以为你觉得哪里剪得不好。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "next": "line-022"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-022",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "我也想知道，你到底调整了多少。你说的“一点广告”，具体是多长？"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-023"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-023",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "两个加起来，十五分钟。中间也留了你们打牌的部分，没有全剪掉。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "next": "cue-008"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-008",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 650
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-024"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-024",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……那个视频原来一共才三分钟。你往三分钟的视频里面，塞了十五分钟的手机回收和按摩仪广告？"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "line-025"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-025",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "不过效果确实挺好的，广告费已经到账了。你看，这样预算的问题也解决了，也许可以考虑邀请更多小伙伴来玩？"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "next": "cue-009"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-009",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "stage",
            "actors": [
              {
                "id": "deepseek",
                "image": "actors/deepseek-playful.png"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "wait",
            "durationMs": 400
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-026"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-026",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "……也许可以考虑。但下次，绝对不会再让你碰我的钱包了。"
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "next": "cue-010"
    },
